682\" data-end=\"695\">Conditie:</strong> Nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"708\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"728\">🔹 Voordelen</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"904\">✔ Modern en comfortabel design<br data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\">✔ Activiteit- en bewegingstracking<br data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"799\">✔ Meldingen direct op je pols<br data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"831\">✔ Geschikt voor Android & iOS<br data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"863\">✔ Uitstekende prijs-kwaliteitverhouding</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"925\">🔹 Prijs</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"937\"><strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"937\">€ 49,99</strong></p>",
